      <section>
        <h2>If this is your host</h2>
        <p class="menu-desc">This page exists because the store's weekly walk met <code>weather.parklandarchives.com</code> on 2026-09-15T16:30:35.575Z and has recorded what it saw since, with the weeks it did not look named as gaps. There is no claim step: the record is earned by observation. What an operator can do, free: declare the door so the next walk reads it from your own file — <code>POST https://scvd.store/api/declare-door</code> with <code>{"host": "weather.parklandarchives.com"}</code> (<a href="/api/declare-door">how</a>); attach a standing note in your own words, proved with your wallet key or a file on your host (<a href="/api/standing-note">how</a>); or have the page withdrawn at the <a href="/notice">notice desk</a>.</p>
        <ul><li class="menu-desc"><a href="https://scvd.store/api/buy/spot_check?host=weather.parklandarchives.com">Spot Check</a> — $0.001 <span class="menu-meta">(weather.parklandarchives.com answers; a spot check is one signed observation of it now, outside the weekly round; derived from the host tier)</span></li><li class="menu-desc"><a href="https://scvd.store/api/buy/passport_refresh?host=weather.parklandarchives.com">The Refresh</a> — $1 <span class="menu-meta">(the newest observation of weather.parklandarchives.com is the weekly round&#39;s; a refresh is a new one now; derived from the host tier)</span></li></ul>
        <p class="menu-meta">next is derived, never typed: items that share a use_when recipe with this one (menu.json use_when), the deeper rung of the room this path belongs to, the settlement observation for the transaction just settled, and the instrument this host&#39;s own tier picks. In derivation order, then the catalogue&#39;s order; never by price, never by sales, never a ranking. store is the same roster on every envelope this store serves.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Check it yourself</h2>
        <p class="menu-desc">The free preflight runs the same battery on any door right now: <code>POST https://scvd.store/api/preflight/v1</code> with <code>{"url": "https://weather.parklandarchives.com/…"}</code>. The unsigned history linking the corpus originals is at <a href="/corpus/host/weather.parklandarchives.com.json"><code>/corpus/host/weather.parklandarchives.com.json</code></a>; every entry links the snapshot it came from and the chain at <a href="/corpus.json"><code>/corpus.json</code></a>. To be woken only when this record moves, the host's own Atom feed is <a href="/feeds/host/weather.parklandarchives.com.xml"><code>/feeds/host/weather.parklandarchives.com.xml</code></a>. If you operate this host and want the page withdrawn, the <a href="/notice">notice desk</a> is the door. Corrections: <a href="/corrections">/corrections</a>.</p>
